{"id":"psalms-53","name":"Psalms","chapter":53,"verses":[{"ref":"Psalms 53:1","englishText":"    The fool has said in his heart, “There is no God.” They are corrupt, and have done abominable iniquity. There is no one who does good. ","tokens":[{"id":"psalms-53-1-0","surface":"לַמְנַצֵּ֥חַ","lemma":"נָצַח","translit":"lamenatsecha","morph":"Preposition dual + Verb Piel Passive Participle","glosses":[],"strongs":"H5329"},{"id":"psalms-53-1-1","surface":"עַֽל","lemma":"עַל","translit":"`al","morph":"Preposition","glosses":[],"strongs":"H5921"},{"id":"psalms-53-1-2","surface":"מָחֲלַ֗ת","lemma":"מַחֲלַת","translit":"machlat","morph":"Noun common feminine singular absolute","glosses":[],"strongs":"H4257"},{"id":"psalms-53-1-3","surface":"מַשְׂכִּ֥יל","lemma":"מַשְׂכִּיל","translit":"mashekiyl","morph":"Noun common masculine singular absolute","glosses":[],"strongs":"H4905"},{"id":"psalms-53-1-4","surface":"לְדָוִֽד","lemma":"דָּוִד","translit":"ledavid","morph":"Preposition + Noun proper","glosses":[],"strongs":"H1732"}],"language":"hebrew"},{"ref":"Psalms 53:2","englishText":"God looks down from heaven on the children of men, to see if there are any who understood, who seek after God. ","tokens":[{"id":"psalms-53-2-0","surface":"אָ֘מַ֤ר","lemma":"אָמַר","translit":"'amar","morph":"Verb Qal Participle 3rd masculine singular","glosses":[],"strongs":"H559"},{"id":"psalms-53-2-1","surface":"נָבָ֣ל","lemma":"נָבָל","translit":"nabal","morph":"Adjective","glosses":[],"strongs":"H5036"},{"id":"psalms-53-2-2","surface":"בְּ֭לִבּוֹ","lemma":"לֵב","translit":"belibvo","morph":"Preposition + Noun common masculine singular construct + Suffix plural 3rd masculine singular","glosses":[],"strongs":"H3820"},{"id":"psalms-53-2-3","surface":"אֵ֣ין","lemma":"אַיִן","translit":"'eyn","morph":"Particle","glosses":[],"strongs":"H369"},{"id":"psalms-53-2-4","surface":"אֱלֹהִ֑ים","lemma":"אֱלֹהִים","translit":"'lohiym","morph":"Noun common masculine plural absolute","glosses":[],"strongs":"H43